cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "OpenChainBench: Live On-Chain Benchmarks Dataset"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Tapponnier
    given-names: Florent
    affiliation: Mobula
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.20800312
    description: Concept DOI (always resolves to the latest version)
repository-code: https://github.com/ChainBench/OpenChainBench
url: https://openchainbench.com
abstract: >-
  OpenChainBench publishes live, reproducible benchmarks for crypto
  infrastructure: data aggregators, bridges, RPC providers, price feeds,
  prediction-market data APIs, L2 networks, oracles, and more. Each
  benchmark ships with the script that produces its data so anyone can
  audit the methodology, add a provider, or contribute a metric. Live
  values refresh every minute on the public site.
keywords:
  - open-data
  - blockchain
  - cryptocurrency
  - benchmarks
  - prediction-markets
  - polymarket
  - kalshi
  - rpc
  - l2
  - oracle
  - web3
license: MIT
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: 2026-06-22
